// KATA k3 — the runaway-loop breaker (an ADLC reliability guardrail).
//
// Agents can get stuck: push, fail, push, fail... burning CI and tokens.
// Requirement:
//   If the tests for PR X failed 3 or more times in the last hour, the agent
//   may not push to X again UNLESS a human granted an "unblock" for X
//   (RequestApproval, kind = "unblock", approved) within the last hour.
//
// Hints:
//   * forbid ... when temporal { ... } unless temporal { ... } is legal.
//   * bind(n, count_within(1h, <predicate>), n >= 3) counts matching events.

@id("tools")
permit (principal, action in Drupe::Action::"CallTool", resource);

